From 60991ab0e75871d04345f265d494cf40b563d092 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tom Wieczorek <twieczorek@mirantis.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 08:27:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Bump dependencies to silence security scanners

Advisories still open in Calico v3.31.7:

* github.com/klauspost/compress v1.18.7 for GO-2026-5841
* google.golang.org/grpc v1.83.2 for CVE-2026-84304, CVE-2026-84303 and
  CVE-2026-84445
* golang.org/x/crypto v0.56.0 for CVE-2026-56855, CVE-2026-78662 and
  GO-2026-5932
* go.opentelemetry.io/otel v1.45.0 for CVE-2026-81870

Generated with `go mod edit -require` and `go mod tidy`, which also
bumps a number of transitive dependencies and raises the go directive
to 1.26.0.

Signed-off-by: Tom Wieczorek <twieczorek@mirantis.com>
---
 go.mod |  68 +++++++++++++-------------
 go.sum | 152 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------------------
 2 files changed, 112 insertions(+), 108 deletions(-)

